OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after woman airlifted to
OL,4,Ahospital in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fdriving while under the influence of
OL,8,Fdrugs after two women were seriously
OL,9,Finjured in crash, with one airlifted to
OL,10,Fhospital.
OL,12,FEmergency services were called to an
OL,13,Fincident involving three vehicles on
OL,14,FFrogmore Road in Market Drayton at
OL,15,Fabout 07:30 BST on Monday, West Mercia
OL,16,FPolice said.
OL,18,FTwo cars, an Audi TT and a Fiat Panda
OL,19,Fcrashed and the drivers of the
OL,20,Fvehicles, two women in their 40s, were
OL,21,Ftaken to hospital with serious
OL,22,Finjuries, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
